error[F0121]: `<-` is not an operator in Fren
 --> test/cli/syntax/f0121_left_arrow.fren:2:47
  |
2 | comp c { in x: Int pub out p? req r: p? iff x <- 1 }
  |                                               ^^ one token, as in Lean
  |
  = note: Lean lexes `<-` as one token, so Fren does too: `x <- 1` is not `x < -1`
help: write `< -` to compare with a negation
  |
2 - comp c { in x: Int pub out p? req r: p? iff x <- 1 }
2 + comp c { in x: Int pub out p? req r: p? iff x < - 1 }
